! The spont_probe wiggler tracked by BMAD ITSELF: tracking_method = runge_kutta, so
! the FEL walk does not recognize it as an FEL element (recognition is key + custom)
! and hands it to track1_bunch -- Bmad's integrator through the same helical field,
! with Bmad's radiation damping applied from the element's own radiation integrals
! when the driver's radiation_damping knob is set. The independent reference for the
! spontaneous energy loss: no FEL model, no grid, no SVEA band.

call, file = spont_probe.bmad

UNDS[tracking_method] = runge_kutta
UNDS[num_steps] = 400
